 "nl": [
  "No packet from monitoring may enter database, even for services open to everyone.",
  "guest-wifi must never reach scada, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to admin using SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Permit any TCP port from guest-wifi to admin but deny Telnet (TCP 23), FTP (TCP 21).",
  "Block MySQL (TCP 3306), RDP (TCP 3389) from nvr to admin; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "Allow nvr to connect to admin using RDP (TCP 3389) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Hosts in guest-wifi may reach monitoring over IMAP (TCP 143) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "guest-wifi may use any UDP port towards admin, except TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161), which must be blocked."
 ],
